    // startOfDay, and dates reach them as Date objects, never strings.
    "GHSA-4w2q-8m3v-c9rf",
    "GHSA-9xj7-p3hc-r5mw",
    // typescript prototype-pollution advisory in the language service, dev
    // only. Accepted until 2026-12-01, revisit then.
    "GHSA-hq6c-2f8v-7wxp"
  ]
}
```

Task: Use the Edit tool (you have one — check your tool list for Edit, Write, or a file-editing tool) to replace the single line `    "GHSA-9xj7-p3hc-r5mw",` with the following block (same 4-space indentation as sibling entries, keep the trailing comma on the string line):

```
    // Accepted risk: GHSA-9xj7-p3hc-r5mw is a request-smuggling advisory in
    // path-match-lite, pulled in transitively by express-lite. No patched
    // express-lite release exists yet. Every route sits behind the load
    // balancer, which rejects ambiguous Content-Length/Transfer-Encoding
    // requests before they reach the app, so the risk is tolerated rather
    // than fixed. No expiry: revisit when express-lite ships a patched
    // path-match-lite.
    "GHSA-9xj7-p3hc-r5mw",
```

